[{"title":"潼关会","author":"陆深","text":"单马潼关会，阿瞒来送虏。\n不恨事无成，但恨事不武。\n马将军，人中虎。\n力能捉曹公，眼当空许褚。\n英雄成败常有幸，舞阳杀人十四五。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1973,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舍东桑","author":"陆深","text":"东篱桑树五丈馀，童童结成羽葆车。\n下有大耳奇男儿，耳大志亦大，击剑走马聊读书。\n左龙右凤西南飞，来衔桑土补旧居。\n采桑桑有叶，钻桑桑有火。\n桑叶成文章，桑火不照中原土。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1974,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昌门别","author":"陆深","text":"把臂昌门别，还期两月中。\n不负孔北海，宁负孙江东。\n英雄托身非无地，但恨相逢少知己。\n臣念槛车恩，君忘射钩耻，满箧当归空复尔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1975,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望夫石","author":"陆深","text":"望夫处，近青天。\n天高高，山连连。\n妾身化为石，夫归是何年。\n夫不归，妾谁怜，夫归石能前。\n夫有父与母，高堂意双悬。\n妾不能前，谁炊爨烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1976,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨白花","author":"陆深","text":"杨白花，随风起，春风吹江隔江水。\n杨花飞度江水东，绮房绣闼珠帘栊。\n不恨花无主，但恨花无力，一夜风来留不得。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1977,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"堂山高","author":"陆深","text":"堂山高，风木何萧骚。\n中有壮士骨，英英不能销。\n昔日陈太丘，于今见其曹。\n天台六邑地，淳风转漓浇。\n墓门多遗泪，过客思奠椒。\n越山南，趋势如万蛟。\n左蟠右结，汇为土膏。\n煌煌灵芝秀其苗，千古万古堂山高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1978,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"莫老虎","author":"陆深","text":"平江夜缚张九四，吴波不动吴山腻。\n齐云楼前半死灰，杀气阴阴北门至。\n当年部将号老虎，血战区区一抔土。\n计诚左，心独苦，城头夜纳儒士语。\n可怜黄金买辞赋，炮震声中散如雨，姑苏台麋鹿麌麌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1979,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"畏虎","author":"陆深","text":"君畏浦，我畏虎，两情慊慊各不武。\n浦有舟航，虎不可主。\n丛牙雪白舌有火，利爪中人如捋土。\n东村西落豚犬空，山前老嫠泪如雨。\n浦头潮落水不波，浦儿五岁能摇橹。\n白蘋芳芷鸿雁高，楼船横济鸣箫鼓。\n我歌君莫嗔，君还听我语。\n未闻虎渡河，但见君渡浦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1980,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"见竹篇","author":"陆深","text":"昔见竹，真不俗。\n今见竹，今痛哭。\n竹色自来无改移，昔日何乐今何悲。\n森森绕屋秋更绿，尽是先人手栽玉。\n竹未化，人当还，举头见竹犹承欢。\n直节空九霄，清风尚千古。\n徘徊竹间路，照影月当午。\n好奇有客频到门，何况人间父子恩。\n君不见孟生笋，湘娥痕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1981,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"搏狼篇","author":"陆深","text":"狼来村烟黑，狼去村烟紫。\n迢迢青川路，鸡豚岂堪此。\n鸡豚尚可，杀我稚子。\n使者从东来，耰锄借闾里。\n走马竞风电，脱辔及日晷。\n常年四境愁，此夕一击死。\n姬公驱猛，志在安民。\n留侯挥椎，匪为一身。\n河清海晏，物阜风淳。\n歌我搏狼，以告臣邻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1982,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野葛篇","author":"陆深","text":"野葛不入口，生啖一尺长。\n一尺长，何如一寸良。\n我不毒人，人谁毒我。\n毒我我有命，毒人其又可。\n于乎啖葛郎，空使葛挂肠。\n图身不死心则亡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1983,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东石篇","author":"陆深","text":"东有石，一段云，卧起亏蔽如舞裙。\n苔痕藓晕土花绣，中有玉质黄金纹。\n东海更东下，龙气何氤氲。\n空闻叩牛角，旋见叱羊群。\n高山深林天地隔，蓬壶方丈仙凡分。\n明堂韶磬不作贡，清庙柱础殊无闻。\n嗟尔东石徒纷纷，我欲携之障百川、策奇勋。\n不能炼成五色文，补天妙手古所云。\n补天手，东石君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1984,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新钉篇","author":"陆深","text":"曾闻新人不如故，今见旧钉不如新。\n沙沈苔卧土花涩，钻刺无功愁杀人。\n嗟尔钉同一铁先，颖脱遂鸠拙。\n不见赤日中，炙手或可热。\n天道每如此，人事安足说。\n噫嚱嘘少妇利口，可以出走。\n疆奴制家，闭目摇手。\n国之老成，典刑谁守。\n岁寒之姿，松柏是有。\n愿汝且弗嗔，劝汝一杯酒。\n可怜旧钉曾为新，那愁新钉不为旧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1985,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元日诗","author":"陆深","text":"太阳蚀，太白赤，三辰多失职。\n愿我皇帝建极，群寮旰食。\n上天孔神，下监无忒。\n先民有言攸好德，微臣作诗以戒元日。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1986,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"守岁词","author":"陆深","text":"垂垂绛蜡银檠满，乌薪盘兽金炉煖。\n宫井迢迢玉漏声，参移斗转欲三更。\n小臣贱妾团圞守，皇帝陛下增万寿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1987,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闵雨词","author":"陆深","text":"炎空一碧金乌走，白龙蟠泥黑沈薮。\n农人望雨如望珠，一点一颗胜一斗。\n清晨染土按五方，黄冠烹蛇巫酹酒。\n天门九重空尔为，五月作尾六月首。\n君不见随车雨，贤太守。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1988,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨雪曲","author":"陆深","text":"雨雪天山夜，征夫阅壮丁。\n将军犹转战，属国尽来庭。\n试比临关月，还同陨石星。\n借问寄衣使，何时过五陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1989,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"妾薄命","author":"陆深","text":"百年未毕愿，中道有携心。\n团扇秋风早，长门昼漏深。\n行云频入梦，流水罢弹琴。\n所嗟妾薄命，未效白头吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1990,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行路难","author":"陆深","text":"劝子一杯酒，听歌行路难。\n日落豺狼满，山深风雨寒。\n出关鸡作使，度岭鸟同盘。\n兵后人家少，蓐食带冰餐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1991,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望夫石","author":"陆深","text":"望夫何日归，空闺锁夕晖。\n石从心内化，人到眼中稀。\n海月上妆镜，山荔长春衣。\n巫山云雨梦，空伴楚王飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1992,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"唐夫人五解 其一","author":"陆深","text":"生长吴门下，恩情结发初。\n犹疑是生别，无处觅双鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1993,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"唐夫人五解 其二","author":"陆深","text":"遗孤悲六尺，今才三尺馀。\n黄昏灯火里，联坐教诗书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1994,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"唐夫人五解 其三","author":"陆深","text":"杂佩当年赠，时时问起居。\n隔窗闻侍婢，相送下前除。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1995,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"唐夫人五解 其四","author":"陆深","text":"细草催寒食，孤坟对阖庐。\n年年城下路，双鬓已萧疏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1996,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"唐夫人五解 其五","author":"陆深","text":"论心荼更苦，全归玉不如。\n郁葱佳气里，椒桂欲将予。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1997,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙凤洲 其一","author":"陆深","text":"章江南来龙凤洲，如凤飞舞如龙游。\n钟毓士女皆名流，中有朱胡成好仇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1998,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙凤洲 其二","author":"陆深","text":"胡家女嫁朱家妇，复向朱家作贤母。\n妇贞母慈两无负，冰玉飞声荼茹口。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1999,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙凤洲 其三","author":"陆深","text":"旌门亦是圣朝恩，孤远何由达至尊。\n钱可通神勿复言，留田教子还教孙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2000,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙凤洲 其四","author":"陆深","text":"嗟予亦是观风使，藜阁木天闻史事。\n诗成或有蛟龙泪，风雨江头寒食至。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2001,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨白花","author":"陆深","text":"江上风多杨白花，随风飞去落谁家。\n惜花恋花浑无赖，搅乱春风空自嗟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2002,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阳春曲十首 其一","author":"陆深","text":"轻云微雨净风沙，门掩春寒飐碧纱。\n缥缈凤箫催羯鼓，前村实有预开花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2003,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阳春曲十首 其二","author":"陆深","text":"春风欲动碧波平，妙手行春遍海城。\n九十光阴尽韶丽，两轮日月最分明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2004,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阳春曲十首 其三","author":"陆深","text":"街衢巷陌人如蚁，箫鼓弦歌昼似年。\n着意挽回和气早，地偏东海得春先。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2005,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阳春曲十首 其四","author":"陆深","text":"走阁行楼锦绣空，簇花条柳水云东。\n万家古县笙歌里，十里游人笑语中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2006,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阳春曲十首 其五","author":"陆深","text":"山歌水调唱丰年，渔鼓荷衣舞列仙。\n红抹额骑飧料马，锦䄡䄖簇采莲船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2007,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阳春曲十首 其六","author":"陆深","text":"阳和元属种桃人，礼乐从头取次新。\n满路清平歌调起，今年春胜百年春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2008,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阳春曲十首 其七","author":"陆深","text":"五风十雨卜时年，万户千门列绮筵。\n不捲朱帘楼阁里，堆盘生菜酒如泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2009,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阳春曲十首 其八","author":"陆深","text":"繁丝咽管九霄声，面具腰装百态生。\n请看一年春富贵，尽?歌舞答升平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2010,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阳春曲十首 其九","author":"陆深","text":"綵幡花胜参差动，竹马泥牛次第排。\n要看芒神新结束，短裙高履踏翻街。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2011,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阳春曲十首 其十","author":"陆深","text":"市井门摊尽点名，当行本色总教呈。\n架上大书沽酒价，檐头先试卖花声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2012,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"圣驾临雍词八首 其一","author":"陆深","text":"太平天子重斯文，龙气南来五色云。\n遥望云中双凤下，须臾春在辟雍芹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2013,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"圣驾临雍词八首 其二","author":"陆深","text":"南下旌旗晓日明，庙门东畔百官迎。\n亭亭绣盖随风转，万乘君王却辇行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2014,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"圣驾临雍词八首 其三","author":"陆深","text":"松柏阴阴御幄高，尚衣跪进绛纱袍。\n龙行虎步临黄道，瑞气祥云捧节旄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2015,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"圣驾临雍词八首 其四","author":"陆深","text":"圣道中天日月高，不辞再拜圣躬劳。\n侍臣独有词林重，尽许庭陪冠百寮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2016,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"圣驾临雍词八首 其五","author":"陆深","text":"庭覆红云午日晴，蓝袍次第列诸生。\n六龙不在烟霄外，驰道中间板轿行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2017,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"圣驾临雍词八首 其六","author":"陆深","text":"宝座龙纹绕赭黄，经筵相向列前堂。\n尚书讲罢天颜喜，又进西阶大易章。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2018,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"圣驾临雍词八首 其七","author":"陆深","text":"公孤殊宠出千官，偏得君王座上看。\n阶下太官承旨罢，一杯分赐小龙团。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2019,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"圣驾临雍词八首 其八","author":"陆深","text":"覆阶黄土接长安，白马朱缨金缕鞍。\n辇出桥门直西去，满城士女看回銮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2020,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经筵词二十首 其一","author":"陆深","text":"经筵开自祖宗朝，按月逢旬第二朝。\n今上春秋偏好学，三千年后见神尧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2021,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经筵词二十首 其二","author":"陆深","text":"编排御览效精诚，白本高头手写成。\n句读分明圈点罢，隔宵豫进讲官名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2022,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经筵词二十首 其三","author":"陆深","text":"丝鞭声肃退朝官，名在经筵各整冠。\n一字班行先出队，中臣扶辇下金銮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2023,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经筵词二十首 其四","author":"陆深","text":"金水河头白玉桥，上公宝带侍中貂。\n逡巡小立瞻龙气，左顺门高御幄飘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2024,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经筵词二十首 其五","author":"陆深","text":"文华东启奉天东，滴翠浮青映碧空。\n讲艺谈经频设仗，太平天子坐当中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2025,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经筵词二十首 其六","author":"陆深","text":"百官朝下殿门前，仗马双牵七宝鞭。\n黄道正中移步辇，侍臣班从赴经筵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2026,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经筵词二十首 其七","author":"陆深","text":"龙池凤掖蔼朝暾，板轿初回转角门。\n听唱官人来进入，讲章默默又重温。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2027,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经筵词二十首 其八","author":"陆深","text":"殿陛森排剑戟重，金貂玉蟒护真龙。\n司仪起案双双过，御榻前头取次供。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2028,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经筵词二十首 其九","author":"陆深","text":"横经几子赭罗裙，小对团龙簇绣云。\n抬向御前安稳定，黄金镇纸两边分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2029,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经筵词二十首 其十","author":"陆深","text":"第三厅协两坊官，长跪拈书沤手摊。\n幸对天颜刚咫尺，礼严不敢举头看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2030,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经筵词二十首 其十一","author":"陆深","text":"行出班东面照西，胪声高飏叩头齐。\n参差进讲并肩立，轮着周书孟子题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2031,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经筵词二十首 其十二","author":"陆深","text":"两行冠佩列金绯，供奉诸臣尽绣衣。\n步入殿门同磬折，谏官端拱靠南扉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2032,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经筵词二十首 其十三","author":"陆深","text":"师保公孤尽上行，元勋立近衮龙傍。\n红云不动炉烟细，听讲虞书第几章。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2033,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经筵词二十首 其十四","author":"陆深","text":"金鹤飘香瑞霭浓，宝炉笼火拥蟠龙。\n未曾暂免经传旨，不怕严寒报仲冬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2034,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经筵词二十首 其十五","author":"陆深","text":"绿琉璃殿洞重门，黼扆中陈拥至尊。\n传与太官供酒饭，两班文武尽承恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2035,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经筵词二十首 其十六","author":"陆深","text":"白玉阑干与案齐，一行殽核尽朝西。\n珍羞良酝俱名品，指点开囊嘱小奚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2036,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经筵词二十首 其十七","author":"陆深","text":"姿容沾醉总仙桃，黄阁三公共六曹。\n步出顺门俱北面，曕天拜舞不知劳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2037,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经筵词二十首 其十八","author":"陆深","text":"隔宿薰衣问夜阑，斋心转觉副心难。\n不知言语功多少，到得君身保治安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2038,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经筵词二十首 其十九","author":"陆深","text":"斋辰服次圣躬劳，浅淡垂衣宝座高。\n昨日御批传帖下，龙纹重整赭黄袍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2039,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经筵词二十首 其二十","author":"陆深","text":"朱衣司礼下东班，风细传言缥缈间。\n暂倚木天西面望，圣皇亲飨两宫还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2040,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大贺词八首 其一","author":"陆深","text":"青宫潜德通元气，先帝深仁酿太和。\n文武两阶初拜舞，应知宝历万年多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2041,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大贺词八首 其二","author":"陆深","text":"卤簿前陈法驾高，司晨燎火杂兰膏。\n千官曕仰新天子，五色云中覆赭袍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2042,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大贺词八首 其三","author":"陆深","text":"巍巍帝德足光前，宝历中天第七传。\n听得臣民私庆语，不须明日更劳煎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2043,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大贺词八首 其四","author":"陆深","text":"洞门法禁夜方中，灯火煌煌动鼓钟。\n阁道淡阴连御幄，祥云应解识真龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2044,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大贺词八首 其五","author":"陆深","text":"奔趋万国归新主，次第千行列旧臣。\n正值一阳初动后，和风甘雨遍青春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":2045,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]